# Visual regression golden images — tracked despite the *.png rule above,
# the test suite needs them to compare against on a fresh checkout.
!test/visual/golden/*.png

# And the two assets a scene of the corpus reads. Ignored, they made
# image_shape.py and chess.py impossible to bake from a clean clone — the repo
# asked its own test suite for files it did not contain.
!wb.png
!pgn

# The chessboard and its twelve pieces. Committed so `chess.py` bakes from a
# clean clone instead of fetching them from chess.com at bake time.
!assets/chess/*.png

